==Battleground==
*1 [[Nono (Enemy)|Nono]] spawns after 8 seconds<sup>240f</sup>.
*1 [[Celesse (Enemy)|Celesse]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*1 [[Norn (Enemy)|Norn]] spawns after 2 seconds<sup>60f</sup>.
*1 [[Serum (Enemy)|Serum]] spawns after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Celesse (Enemy)|Celesses]] spawn after 22 seconds<sup>660f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Nono (Enemy)|Nonos]] spawn after 24 seconds<sup>720f</sup>, delay 13.33~30 seconds<sup>400f~900f</sup>.
*3 [[Serum (Enemy)|Serums]] spawn after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>, delay 20~30 seconds<sup>600f~900f</sup>.
*4 [[Norn (Enemy)|Norns]] spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 16.67~33.33 seconds<sup>500f~1,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Cornelia (Enemy)|Cornelia]] spawns as the boss.
**4 [[Serum (Enemy)|Serums]] spawn, delay 62~66 seconds<sup>1,860f~1,980f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Celesse (Enemy)|Celesses]] spawn, delay 60~62 seconds<sup>1,800f~1,860f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Nono (Enemy)|Nonos]] spawn, delay 58~60 seconds<sup>1,740f~1,800f</sup>.
**5 [[Norn (Enemy)|Norns]] spawn, delay 64~68 seconds<sup>1,920f~2,040f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

